    body: "Pins & Needles Comedy is officially accepting performer submissions for our Edinburgh Fringe run.\n\nThis summer, **Pins & Needles** is bringing our tattoo-heavy stand-up show to **The Raging Bull in Edinburgh**, with shows running **August 6\u201318 at 10:15 PM nightly**.\n\nWe are looking for bold, sharp, funny comics who want to be part of a visually striking, underground stand-up show built around tattoos, vulnerability, and strong comedy.\n\nThe format is simple: tattooed comedians perform stand-up while revealing their tattoos onstage. No nudity. No gimmick replacing the jokes. The comedy still has to hit first.\n\nWe are also accepting submissions for our **POSER spot**, reserved for a non-tattooed comic who wants to step into the format from the outside.\n\nComics selected for the show should be comfortable with the visual concept, able to do a tight set, and ready to promote their Edinburgh appearance.\n\n**Show details:**\n\n**Pins & Needles Comedy**\n**Edinburgh Fringe**\n**The Raging Bull**\n**August 6\u201318**\n**10:15 PM nightly**\n\nSubmissions are open now.\n\n## **[Apply here](https://comedysub.vercel.app)**\n\nStrip down for stand up.",
