    excerpt: "Pins & Needles Comedy is back at Secret Pour on Thursday, July 30 at 8:30 PM for another tattoo-heavy night of stand-up, flash art, artists, drinks, and New York City comedy that does not feel like\u2026",
    body: "## Pins & Needles Comedy Returns July 30 with Flash Tattoos, Artist Pop-Up, and Two POSER Comics\n\nPins & Needles Comedy is back at **Secret Pour** on **Thursday, July 30 at 8:30 PM** for another tattoo-heavy night of stand-up, flash art, artists, drinks, and New York City comedy that does not feel like every other comedy show.\n\nThis one is special: for the first time, we are bringing in **two POSER comics**.\n\nFor anyone new to the show, Pins & Needles is built around the tagline **\u201cStrip down for stand up.\u201d** Tattooed comics perform in show garments and reveal their tattoos as part of the night\u2019s visual world. But every show also has a POSER spot: a comic without tattoos who steps into the format anyway.\n\nOn July 30, we are doubling it.\n\nThat means two non-tattooed comics entering a tattoo-heavy lineup, fully aware they are the odd ones out. It adds a new layer to the show: tattooed comics, tattoo culture, body art, flash designs, and two brave POSERS trying to survive the room without a single tattoo to defend themselves.\n\nPins & Needles is not a standard comedy show in the back of a bar. It is part stand-up, part tattoo night, part artist pop-up, and part underground hang. The night brings together comics, tattoo artists, visual artists, vendors, raffles, flash tattoos, drinks, and an audience that wants something more visually interesting than a regular lineup.\n\nThe show is bold, intimate, tattoo-heavy, and built to feel like a full night out. Comics are not just telling jokes. They are part of the look, the format, and the room.\n\nExpect stand-up, flash tattoos, an artist pop-up, vendors, raffles, drinks, and the kind of post-show hang that keeps the night going after the mic turns off.\n\n## Event Details\n\n**Event:** Pins & Needles Comedy Show: Flash Tattoos + Artist Pop-Up\n**Date:** Thursday, July 30\n**Time:** 8:30 PM\n**Venue:** Secret Pour\n**Location:** 1114 DeKalb Avenue, New York City\n**Featuring:** Stand-up comedy, flash tattoos, artist pop-up, vendors, raffles, drinks, and two POSER comics\n**Tickets:** [Available now on Eventbrite](https://www.eventbrite.com/e/pins-needles-comedy-show-flash-tattoos-artist-pop-up-tickets-1990808413556?aff=oddtdtcreator)\n\nCome for the comedy. Stay for the ink, the art, the room, and the two POSERS brave enough to walk into a tattoo show with nothing to reveal.",
